- Description: `GET /insights/risks` and `GET /insights/summary` execute database `UPDATE` queries modifying service statuses to `"at_risk"`. According to RFC 7231, GET requests must be safe and idempotent. Automated health checks, browser link prefetching, and network retries will mutate database state.
